(println "=== 4. PERFORMANCE COMPARISON ===")
(println)
(println "Direct C linking advantages:")
(println "• ZERO overhead - just a normal C function call")
(println "• Compiler optimizations work across boundaries")
(println "• Can inline small functions")
(println "• No runtime type checking needed")
(println "• No wrapper functions")
(println "• No libffi dependency")
(println)
